Subject: [PATCH 11/38] ARM: dts: r8a7745: Add Inter Connect RAM
Date: Mon, 31 Jul 2017 17:19:23 +0200
Message-Id: <825216b8160b53b83f405a1e7b6c647e4e99e25a.1501514100.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
